{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 60,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In popular culture, the\nterm IQ is everywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3600,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Do IQ exams do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5040,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You probably need 120 points of IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7740,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Don't know what my IQ is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8699,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9532,
    "dDurationMs": 1099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- IQ.\n- IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10631,
    "dDurationMs": 982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Low IQ individual."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11613,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- People who boast about\ntheir IQ are losers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16440,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When people say IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18360,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what they mean is intelligence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20820,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an objective, rigorous measurement\nof intellectual ability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25560,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But does it actually work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28050,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, in this video, I want to find out:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29790,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where IQ came from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31650,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does it actually measure?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33780,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What can it predict about your life?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35640,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I guess, what is my IQ?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40050,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have never taken an\nofficial IQ test before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43080,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Honestly, I don't think\nI'm terribly smart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45210,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've always kind of considered my IQ to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47460,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe just a little above average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49212,
    "dDurationMs": 938,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Exothermic or endothermic?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50150,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I feel like that should be exothermic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53670,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Good job, science guy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55410,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There are a lot of IQ tests online,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57690,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I am very skeptical\nabout their accuracy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61110,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, I figured some of\nthem may be good practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63720,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the real thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64650,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tomorrow I'm going to\ndo an IQ test for real."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67560,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before I do that, I want\nto try to improve my score,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70920,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I'm going to try to do a\nwhole bunch of practice tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73440,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this test is trainable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76980,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But tomorrow we're going to\nsee whether that's true or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80130,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea of intelligence testing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82350,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "goes back hundreds of years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84600,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the first concrete\nbreakthrough occurred in 1904."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89070,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "English psychologist Charles Spearman"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91140,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was studying students'\ngrades in different subjects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94680,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he wondered how their\nperformance in one subject,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97440,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like English, would relate\nto their performance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99570,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in another, like Math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101670,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One option would be that the\nbetter a student did in math,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105270,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the worse they would do in English,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107730,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe because they spent\nmore time on their math work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110430,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so had less time to devote to English."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113580,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So performance in different subjects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 115350,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be negatively correlated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117810,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another option was that\nperformance in one subject"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120300,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be completely unrelated\nto performance in another."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123630,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, different subjects\nrequire different skill sets,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126930,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so maybe marks would be\ntotally uncorrelated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130650,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third option was that the\nbetter a student did in math,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134310,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the better they would do in English."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136890,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words, their marks\nwould be positively correlated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140670,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A correlation coefficient can vary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142530,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anywhere from negative\none to positive one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A correlation coefficient of negative one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147960,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "indicates a perfect negative correlation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150750,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning an increase in\none variable corresponds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153630,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to a precise, predictable\ndecrease in the other variable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157890,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Similarly, a correlation of positive one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160470,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "indicates a perfect positive correlation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163740,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A correlation of zero indicates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165900,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no relationship between the two variables."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168630,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And any value between zero and one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171090,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "indicates a positive correlation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173400,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the data has some random spread."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176580,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The square of the correlation coefficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178830,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tells you the amount of\nvariation in one variable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181890,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can be explained by\nvariation in the other variable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185550,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, if the\ncorrelation coefficient is 0.5,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188730,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then 25% of the variation in one variable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192240,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be explained by the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194670,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When Spearman analyzed his data,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197070,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he found a clear positive correlation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 200160,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Students who did better in math"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201900,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also tended to do better in English,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204270,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the correlation coefficient was 0.64."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208500,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Math and English\nweren't the only subjects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211080,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the students studied."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212400,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also took Classics and French."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215100,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when Spearman looked\nat the correlations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216930,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between all of these subjects,\nhe found the same pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221130,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Students who did well in one subject"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 223230,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tended to do well in them all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225510,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how do you explain this observation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228780,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Spearman proposed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230700,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that each person has some\nlevel of general intelligence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234330,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what he called the g-factor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236730,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This construct was meant\nto capture how quickly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239250,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "students could learn new\nmaterial, recognize patterns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242400,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and think critically regardless\nof the subject matter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245460,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which explains why students' scores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247200,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "across subjects are correlated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248910,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those with high g, score\nwell on all subjects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252090,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those with low g, score\npoorly on all subjects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255600,
    "dDurationMs": 2827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spearman published his\nconclusions in a paper titled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258427,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"General Intelligence\" Objectively\nDetermined and Measured."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263160,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the correlations weren't perfect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265560,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on top of the g-factor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267660,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spearman proposed subject-specific\nfactors, or s-factors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272100,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A student's performance\nin math, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273900,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would depend on their general intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275940,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "plus their subject\nspecific factor for math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279480,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Subject specific factors could increase"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281550,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or decrease performance on\nthat particular subject."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285150,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spearman believed that specific\nfactors could be trained"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288390,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but general intelligence was fixed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291210,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he wanted to find a\nway to reliably measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294930,
    "dDurationMs": 1713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "general intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297540,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At around the same time in France,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299790,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Alfred Binet was tasked with figuring out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302190,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which kids needed more help in school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305310,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Together with Theodore Simon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306990,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he developed the Benet-Simon test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310170,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Students were asked to name\nwhat's missing in the drawing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313500,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "define abstract terms,\nand repeat back sentences."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317670,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was also this question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319290,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "asking which face is prettiest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322170,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were 30 tasks in all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325260,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their performance was benchmarked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326850,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against other students of different ages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329190,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to assign them a mental age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332640,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, if a student performed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334350,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about as well as the\naverage eight year old,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336450,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their mental age would be eight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339000,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This mental age was then\ndivided by their actual age"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342150,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and multiplied by a hundred to arrive"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344610,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a so-called intelligence\nquotient, and IQ was born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350580,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the Binet-Simon test was\nthe world's first IQ test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354570,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was translated by Goddard into English"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357030,
    "dDurationMs": 1623,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and brought to the U.S."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360720,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At Stanford, Lewis Terman standardized it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363480,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "using a large American sample,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365640,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with some modifications it became"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367620,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Stanford-Binet test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369660,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and for decades it was\nthe most widely used test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372930,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the United States."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374790,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this was just the start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 376770,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many other IQ tests were developed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379110,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they all had the same goal\nof measuring the g-factor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383250,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way they did this was by assessing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385350,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "many different mental abilities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387180,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including memory, verbal,\nspatial, and numerical skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392580,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one of these areas might\nhave a subject-specific shift."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396330,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But by averaging them all together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398250,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the idea was the subject-specific\neffects would cancel out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402330,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaving a decent approximation of g."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405900,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, there would\nalways be some error."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408630,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But that's why psychologists\ndesigned IQ tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410940,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with upwards of seven to 10\nsections with distinct tasks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414870,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try to minimize\nsubject-specific distortions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418590,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the different IQ tests differed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420690,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the number of questions\nand their difficulty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423570,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to standardize the scoring system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426270,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each test was given to a large\nsample of the population."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429780,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Raw scores were normalized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432270,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "usually so the mean was a hundred"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434460,
    "dDurationMs": 2247,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the standard deviation was 15,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436707,
    "dDurationMs": 3243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's how it's\nstill done to this day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439950,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442230,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's meant to be a measure\nof an individual's g-factor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445470,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in comparison to the\nrest of the population."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448590,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The way it's scaled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450450,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "68% of people have an\nIQ between 85 and 115."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455730,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Only around 2% score over 130 or under 70."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461398,
    "dDurationMs": 1922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(tranquil music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463320,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "11 lions, four cats, and\nseven crows have a total of..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468380,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, boy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469890,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I was studying for my IQ test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472320,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I practiced all the\ndifferent types of questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474570,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that appear on modern tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476850,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One section will almost\ncertainly be on vocabulary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480630,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They give you one word like sanguine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483720,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have to pick which of\nthe multiple choice options"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486780,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is most similar in meaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489210,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it gloomy, asinine, recalcitrant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492990,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "optimistic, or reflective?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495780,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They might also ask you to pick a word"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497640,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the opposite meaning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 499170,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is the opposite of perspicacious?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502500,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it canny, obsequious,\ndull, fanciful, or sagacious?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508920,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another section tests your ability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510630,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to spot patterns with numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513030,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So pick the number that\nbest completes the pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515790,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "3, 5, 8, 12."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518730,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What comes next?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520500,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Originally, I was looking\nfor complicated patterns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523170,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but as I familiarized myself\nwith the online tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525870,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I discovered the patterns\nwere usually pretty simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528930,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A good technique is to find the difference"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530850,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between adjacent terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532530,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this case, the first two\nterms are separated by two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535710,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the next by three, and then four."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538590,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the logical next term should\nbe five more than 12, so 17."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543300,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is C."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545580,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sometimes the numbers grow rapidly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547530,
    "dDurationMs": 4470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like in the sequence three, 15, 60, 180."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 552000,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What comes next?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553590,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In cases like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554700,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I look at the ratio of one\nnumber to the one before it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558480,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, the second\nnumber is five times the first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561870,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next number is four times bigger,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564270,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the next one is three times larger."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566790,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the answer should be\ntwo times the fourth term,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569670,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is 360, answer B."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573540,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the best known\ntypes of IQ test questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576330,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are Raven's progressive matrices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578520,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These involve a three by three grid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580320,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with symbols in each of the cells,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582540,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have to select"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583500,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ninth cell which follows the pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586380,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I found that the bulk of these puzzles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 588420,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "obey one of only a few\ndifferent logical rules."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591840,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is translational motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594060,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the symbols move from\none cell to the next"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596400,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a predictable fashion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598440,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second is rotational motion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601080,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One or several objects rotate\nfrom one cell to the next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605670,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third is missing symbols,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607710,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where in each row or column\neach symbol appears once."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611910,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to figure out which symbols\nappear in the final cell,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614220,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you just have to spot\nwhich ones are missing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617160,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fourth is addition,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 619350,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where the first cell plus the second cell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621540,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equals the third cell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623400,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this case, lines\nthat overlap cancel out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626460,
    "dDurationMs": 3213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but a line plus nothing equals a line."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631020,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In most modern IQ tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632700,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the questions are\ncompleted under time pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635460,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may have only around 10\nto 30 seconds per question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639390,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, this morning I'm\ntaking an official IQ test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642510,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I got to say that I'm pretty nervous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644850,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I always want to do well on tests,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646890,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's something I pride myself on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648840,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the same time, who\nknows how this is going to go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652470,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm not allowed to take you in there,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653640,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because obviously people don't want"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654900,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the questions getting out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655770,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they don't even want video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656970,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what it looks like in there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658560,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're very strict about these things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659970,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to go in, do the test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662400,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll come out and I'll\nlet you know how it went."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664830,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wish me luck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665970,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's remarkable about IQ tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667950,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that an hour or two of\nquestions on vocabulary,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671580,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "numbers, and arbitrary shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673860,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can predict a surprising\namount about your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677340,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For one thing, the higher your IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679560,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the larger your brain is likely to be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 682620,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large meta-analysis from 2005"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 685170,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "estimated a correlation of\n0.33 between IQ and brain size."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690570,
    "dDurationMs": 3876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So high IQ is literally big brain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694446,
    "dDurationMs": 3024,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IQ is also predictive of school success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697470,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2007, Scottish psychiatrist Ian Deary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700650,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "measured the IQs of 13,000 11 year-olds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704130,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And five years later, when\nthese students completed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706560,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "national school examinations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 708360,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Deary compared their\nexam marks to their IQs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 711900,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Their performance on an\nIQ test when they were 11"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714690,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "correlated with their performance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716010,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five years later on the GCSEs, about 0.8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718890,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's an extremely high correlation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722160,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It means about two\nthirds of the variation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724140,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in national school examination scores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726210,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could be predicted by IQ\ntests taken five years prior."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730920,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the correlation\ncoefficient of this study"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733110,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is at the high end of the 0.2 to 0.8 range"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735930,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "found in similar studies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737550,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But research supports the claim that IQ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739620,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a good predictor of school success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742020,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It also predicts how much\nschooling a person will complete."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746010,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe this shouldn't be so surprising"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748380,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since some school tests\nare essentially IQ tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751830,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's been argued that tests\nlike the SAT, ACT, and the GRE"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756570,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are basically IQ tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 758700,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They correlate with standard\nIQ tests at around 0.8."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762270,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, on my SATs I got a score of 1,330,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765060,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which of corresponds\nto an IQ of around 130."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768360,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it'll be interesting to see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769350,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if my official IQ score matches that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771690,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or if I was able to increase my score"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773460,
    "dDurationMs": 3513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by familiarizing myself\nwith IQ-style questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 776973,
    "dDurationMs": 1173,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 778146,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But IQ also has predictive\npower outside of school."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781680,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the most robust findings"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783420,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that IQ can predict job success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786360,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Particularly in technical\nor high complexity jobs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790920,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How do you measure occupational success?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794070,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You ask people's bosses to rate them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796650,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You ask what people's income is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799260,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You measure productivity\nin ways that economists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801840,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use about the output generated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804510,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The correlations typically\nrange from 0.2 to 0.6,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808350,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the effect is most\nnotable for more complex jobs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811500,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812910,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The highest effect is\nfor military training."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816180,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the U.S. military\nwill not accept anyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819210,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with an IQ under 80."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 821580,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also limit to 20%\nthe number of recruits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824280,
    "dDurationMs": 2823,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with IQs between 81 and 92."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 827940,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the Vietnam war,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830280,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to increase\nthe pool of applicants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832740,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they relaxed this last requirement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835530,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what they found was that\nthose below the threshold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838620,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were 1.5 to three times as\nlikely to fail recruit training,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 843660,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they required between\nthree to nine times"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847020,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as much remedial training."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849120,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Taken together, this added so much strain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851730,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the military ran more efficiently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854010,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without the extra recruits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856260,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In total, 5,478 people recruited\nunder this initiative died"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861270,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a fatality rate three times higher"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 863760,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than ordinary recruits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865560,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the military reinstated\ntheir requirements,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 867840,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and today anyone with an IQ less than 80,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 870900,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that is about 30 million Americans,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873690,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be ineligible to join the military."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877680,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even outside the military,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879600,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IQ seems to play a role\nin how long you live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882660,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a Scottish study,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883680,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientists uncovered IQ tests from kids"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they were 11 years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887790,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now 65 years later, they check\nto see who from the sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890940,
    "dDurationMs": 1947,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was still alive at age 76."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892887,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they found that on average,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 894330,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for every 15 point\nincrease on the IQ test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897210,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would be 27% more likely\nto still be alive at age 76."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901800,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large meta-analysis confirms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904170,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that people with higher IQs\nhave a lower risk of dying"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907350,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during the timeframe\ninvestigated in each study."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911040,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The last major thing that IQ\nseems to predict is income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 914730,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This study shows a clear tendency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 916740,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for income to increase with IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919080,
    "dDurationMs": 2343,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it found a correlation\ncoefficient of 0.3."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 922260,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the variance is huge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924030,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, the top three\nearners in this study"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926040,
    "dDurationMs": 2493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all had IQs below 100."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929610,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large meta-analysis of 31 studies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931710,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "found the correlation between\nIQ and income to be 0.21."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935250,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is significant but small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937470,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means that only 4.4%\nof the variance in income"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940590,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is explained by IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942390,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe one of the reasons why we don't see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944010,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as high a correlation for income"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945510,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just because economically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948690,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intelligence is not necessarily\nthat highly rewarded,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952080,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that maybe there are jobs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954270,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like just doing a real estate-type scheme,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958680,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe that doesn't require a\nhuge amount of intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961590,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Simultaneously, you have all these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963120,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very highly intelligent people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964440,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who maybe become college professors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965910,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that doesn't\nnecessarily pay very well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968790,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969623,
    "dDurationMs": 2737,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A lot of people who have\nvery high intelligence scores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 972360,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't have the same interest\nin accumulating money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976800,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- The relationship with\nnet worth is even weaker."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979650,
    "dDurationMs": 1983,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It hardly seems to correlate with IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982530,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even though people with higher IQs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984030,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are supposedly more intelligent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985500,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and on average they make\nmore money each year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988320,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this apparently doesn't translate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990120,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into saving or accumulating\nmore wealth overall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994470,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if IQ correlates\nwith school achievement,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997350,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "job performance, income, and longevity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999900,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why don't we hear more about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002090,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why aren't more people tested?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004460,
    "dDurationMs": 3573,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's because\nIQ has a dark history."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010130,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When Henry Goddard brought\nBinet's test to America,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013520,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "its use and interpretation\nshifted dramatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017420,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In France, Binet believed intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019640,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could be improved through education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022010,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He designed his tests so\nthat struggling students"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024470,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could be given more help to catch up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027230,
    "dDurationMs": 4030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the U.S., the modified\ntest was given to adults"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032540,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to rank them by intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1036620,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And researchers like Spearman believed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1038600,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that g was unchangeable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040730,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that whatever general\nintelligence you were born with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043460,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you would have for the rest of your life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046130,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And many thought g was inherited,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049070,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "passed down from parents to children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1051530,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days we would say\nit has a genetic basis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054920,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is some evidence to\nsupport these assertions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057890,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IQ appears fairly consistent\nover one's lifetime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1061460,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So they had tests done when\npeople were 11 years old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064730,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They found all those\ntests in a filing cabinet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067700,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and followed those people up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069080,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gave them the same test\nwhen they were 90 years old,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1072440,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much, much later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073790,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Their scores 80 years apart"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1076190,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were correlated at around 0.5 to 0.6."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080420,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's also evidence for\na genetic basis to IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083630,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You find, for instance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1084560,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that if you get two identical twins"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086030,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and give them an IQ test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087320,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have a very strong correlation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089150,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's actually about the same"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091010,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as giving the same person\nthe test a few weeks apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096560,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Henry Goddard used the claims"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098570,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that intelligence was\ninherited and unchangeable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101990,
    "dDurationMs": 4023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to put IQ at the center of the\nAmerican eugenics movement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107330,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Eugenicists wanted to prevent\nthose with undesirable traits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111200,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from having kids."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113030,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In many states, laws were passed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115190,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to enable forced sterilization of people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117860,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who failed to meet a certain\nthreshold on an IQ test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1122210,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The constitutionality of these laws"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1124190,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was upheld by the Supreme Court in 1927."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128090,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Even words that we\nnow use as in insults,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1130970,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moron, idiot, imbecile, were\nused as scientific terms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135770,
    "dDurationMs": 3307,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In his judgment, Justice\nOliver Wendell Holmes wrote,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1139077,
    "dDurationMs": 1493,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It is better for all the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140570,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if instead of waiting to execute"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142340,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "degenerate offspring for crime,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144080,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or to let them starve\nfor their imbecility,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1146300,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "society can prevent those\nwho are manifestly unfit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149030,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from continuing their kind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151160,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three generations of\nimbeciles are enough.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154700,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In total, over 60,000 people\nwere forcibly sterilized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1159200,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a result of these laws."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161420,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, they served as\na model for Nazi Germany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165410,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hitler himself claimed to be inspired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167660,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by American eugenicists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1170030,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- These have been used for\nhorrific things in the past."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1174290,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- At the Nuremberg trials after the war,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1176360,
    "dDurationMs": 3783,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some Nazis quoted from the\nAmerican Supreme Court decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181700,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Given this awful history,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1183650,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's understandable\nthat many people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185630,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "completely disregard IQ today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188510,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the science of intelligence,\nthere are a number of things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1191360,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those early researchers got wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193910,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is that IQ is not entirely\ndetermined by genetics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198080,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you quantify the effects\nof genetics versus environment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1202670,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When you look at twin studies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204380,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on average, across the whole\nlifespan, it's about 50/50"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207440,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to heritability and environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210890,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You simply can't, for ethical reasons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1214610,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "estimate it in humans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216740,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a reasonable degree\nof certainty or accuracy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219530,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Given my reading of that literature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1221540,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a pretty broad range,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1223070,
    "dDurationMs": 4827,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probably somewhere between 40% and 70%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1227897,
    "dDurationMs": 1143,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229040,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since education can improve IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1231620,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is not completely\nfixed over a lifetime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234920,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus, intelligence might\nnot be a single construct"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237950,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as initially imagined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239450,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days, scientists recognize\ntwo forms of intelligence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242840,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fluid and crystallized."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244880,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fluid intelligence is\nyour ability to learn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247550,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "process information, and\nsolve novel problems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250760,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas crystallized intelligence involves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252590,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the knowledge you've\naccumulated over your lifetime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1255860,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both types of intelligence\nincrease throughout childhood,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1259190,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but fluid intelligence\npeaks in early adulthood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262040,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then declines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1263210,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas crystallized\nintelligence remains more stable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266930,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But IQ has been further misused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269540,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to promote the idea of racial\ndifferences in intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273200,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is, for example, an observed gap"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1275300,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between the average IQ of\nblack and white Americans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1278990,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Articles have also been\npublished on the IQs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281000,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of different nations around the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283310,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many of these nations\nare purported to have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285440,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "average IQs below 70."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1287900,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the cutoff for\nintellectual disability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1290810,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How could this be?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293120,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The conclusion that some draw"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294860,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that there are genetic differences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296510,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between races or nations in intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300350,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that's a gross\nmisrepresentation of the data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1304520,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem, I'd argue, is that IQ tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307460,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't necessarily measure what\nyou think they're measuring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310790,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the proof is that there's\na representative sample"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313250,
    "dDurationMs": 4053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of white Americans whose average IQ is 70."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318140,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who are these people?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320270,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just ordinary Americans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322190,
    "dDurationMs": 2223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who lived around a hundred years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325250,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Researcher James Flynn\nstudied the average results"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1328550,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of IQ tests over the past century,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1330830,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and every so often, the tests\nget updated and re-normalized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1334340,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to keep their average at a hundred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1336770,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, what Flynn noticed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337760,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was that each time they got re-normalized,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340070,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the scores had to be\nshifted down a bit more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1343040,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by about two or three\nIQ points per decade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345950,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if they didn't do\nthis, what we would see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347840,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the average IQ\nof the whole population"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350750,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was increasing at a steady rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352400,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the last a 100 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354020,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "adding up to around a 30 point increase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356900,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is known as the Flynn Effect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359630,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Were our immediate ancestors"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1361550,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the verge of mental retardation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364730,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because 70 is normally the\nscore for mental retardation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369020,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or are we on the verge\nof all being gifted?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372020,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because 130 is the cutting\nline for giftedness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375740,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Now the genetics of the population"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377390,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "haven't really changed\nover a hundred years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379940,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what caused the increase?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382790,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, there is some debate\nabout the true causes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385070,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but one of them is probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387110,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "improving childhood nutrition and health."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1389660,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You know, height also increased\nacross that time period."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1391880,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People got taller, and taller, and taller."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393260,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Another cause is better education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395540,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- There's lots of evidence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396410,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that school makes you more intelligent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1398000,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- You become better at problem solving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400610,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have more knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402350,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's easier for\nyou to make associations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406610,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you have more things to\nmake the associations with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410660,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- A third proposed cause is a shift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412850,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the types of work that most people do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415490,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from mostly manual labor\na hundred years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418100,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to much more abstract thinking these days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421340,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that shift may have made us better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423590,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at answering the types of questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425540,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are asked on IQ tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428540,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rotate again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430280,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The point is that IQ tests appear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433250,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to objectively measure\nintelligence, but they don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1437450,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even in the same country,\nseparated only by time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1441230,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cultural changes can affect\nthe average scores on IQ tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445760,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why shouldn't we expect\ncultural differences"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447860,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between groups at the same\ntime to have the same effect?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1451190,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some tests go so far as to\nlabel themselves culture fair,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454580,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning the questions\nshould be equally valid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456470,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for all cultures."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457880,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the truth is it's impossible\nto construct such a test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461660,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does that work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463160,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1464420,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1465980,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No. I mean, that's just a title, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467630,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's just a marketing term."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1468830,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't think there is such a thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1470720,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a completely culture\nfree or culture fair test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474800,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Culture fair tests\nassess visual relations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477410,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "geometric shapes and patterns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479450,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ignoring the fact that cultures differ in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1481460,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for example, whether they\nhave words for shapes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1484010,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or spatial relations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485840,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These differences influence\nhow people think about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488600,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and use categories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1490400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also debatable whether cultures"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492200,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without printed materials\neven perceive them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494810,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the same way that we do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1496880,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What culture fair tests don't assess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498860,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is ethnobotanical knowledge,\nor training dogs to hunt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1502250,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or surviving alone in the rainforest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1504410,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Arguably, these forms of intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506090,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are more important for survival"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1507560,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than knowing, say the next\nnumber in the sequence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510380,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But since they're less\ncommon in our culture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512630,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we don't have good\nways of measuring them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514790,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we see IQ puzzles as the definitive way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1517400,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to quantify intelligence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519380,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the people who make these tests agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1521690,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are stringent\nrequirements before a test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523940,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "validated for one population"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1525410,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be used with a very\ndifferent population."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528500,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even in the limited forms of intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530690,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that IQ attempts to assess,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532580,
    "dDurationMs": 3513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are factors other than\ng which affect the final IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538700,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like motivation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1540200,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much someone is incentivized\nto complete the test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542930,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can have a marked impact on their score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1545690,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many studies have tried paying subjects"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547880,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to complete an IQ test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549650,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some studies, they're offered a little,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1551960,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "say around a dollar."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1553400,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other studies offer between $1 and $10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556340,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the real high rollers\noffer more than $10."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1559430,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large meta-analysis showed\nthat motivating people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562130,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this way increased IQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564440,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the larger the dollar amount,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1566090,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the greater the average increase."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568130,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the high end, IQ\nincreased by up to 20 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572300,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The effect is largest for\nthose with below average IQs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575390,
    "dDurationMs": 4293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in addition to g, IQ tests\nalso measure motivation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581150,
    "dDurationMs": 1473,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it doesn't stop there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584930,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do rotate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1586250,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Training and coaching for an IQ test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1588530,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can boost scores by up to eight points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1591590,
    "dDurationMs": 4384,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just completed the test\nin some random notice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595974,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(mumbles)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1596807,
    "dDurationMs": 993,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can barely talk after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597800,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seemed pretty fair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599270,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were lots of different sections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601730,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The math section in particular,\nI feel like I killed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604160,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those questions were easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605720,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would say having done the test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607100,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like that should be trainable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608660,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like you should be able to\ntrain someone to do that well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1611270,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Test taking strategy is also important."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613370,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some people are just\nbetter at taking tests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615590,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "under time pressure than others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617510,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the hardest thing about the test"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1619100,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was the time limits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620390,
    "dDurationMs": 2273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Looking for the patterns\nin a series of shapes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622663,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it just normally\ntakes me a little while,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1625190,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so I feel like I didn't finish those."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1627530,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to know when to skip questions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629420,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to eliminate clearly wrong\nanswers, and when to guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633440,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anxiety also plays a role."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635390,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apparently a small amount\nof anxiety is good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1638120,
    "dDurationMs": 3513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but past a certain point, it\nnegatively impacts performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642740,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I guess the overall review\nis, I think I did okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1647990,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think the training\nactually really, really helped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651080,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's my prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1652130,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let us fast forward to the future"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1653600,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see how I actually did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656000,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually got my results"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1657590,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the author of the IQ test I took."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660320,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Those are three areas,\nthree specific areas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1664160,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- For the math one, for the numbers ones,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666230,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's where I\nfelt really comfortable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and got there before the time was done"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671240,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I could go back\nand look at a few things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672950,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673970,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You blew the roof off\nthe quantitative one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1676370,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the quantitative, it was 143."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679190,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas on the crystallized\nintelligence index, it was 132."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682820,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fluid intelligence index was 118."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687367,
    "dDurationMs": 1513,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hmm.\n- Which still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1688880,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a higher score than 88.5%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692913,
    "dDurationMs": 1217,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's not, bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1694130,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's interesting that that one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695660,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is significantly lower, I guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699740,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And that's not an unusual difference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701990,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Around that concept of g,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703730,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people have strengths and weaknesses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706550,
    "dDurationMs": 3955,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we were to look at the\nbest estimate of g for you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1710505,
    "dDurationMs": 1895,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on this set of tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1712400,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it'd be different if\nyou took a different test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1714160,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was at 134, which is higher\nthan 98.8% of the population."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721160,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723230,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Hopefully you're not\ndisappointed with any of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725390,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726223,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to do well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728043,
    "dDurationMs": 2147,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like my motivation was high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1730190,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "possibly higher than the average person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733160,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what is IQ good for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735950,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- My clinical practice now\nis forensic neuroscience,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738980,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and about 90% of my\ncases are death penalty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742340,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of the most common issues is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745040,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what's referred to as the Atkins defense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747590,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the name of the\nUS Supreme Court case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749840,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that eliminated the death penalty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751340,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for people with intellectual disability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753650,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Can't the criminal\njust throw the IQ test?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756410,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can't they just intentionally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757520,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- No.\n- answer every question wrong?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758780,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- We'd know that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759890,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, we include, just like\nin the test that you took,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764150,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are embedded measures of invalidity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767870,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's detected using various\nmathematical algorithms."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771200,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We're better than 95% accurate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773180,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in detecting people who are attempting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775040,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to fake poor performance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776840,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Oh, wow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1778460,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One thing that we may\nbe interested in doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1780770,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to boost people's cognitive\nability early in life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1783650,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that it takes them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784730,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if they go into cognitive decline,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1787370,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it takes them longer to reach the point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1790610,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they'll have sort of functional"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1792950,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actual everyday problems\nwhere they lose independence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795740,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whether it comes to\ndealing with their money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798020,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or whether it comes to\ndealing with reading labels,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801650,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "whatever it is that people struggle with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803420,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they get into later\nstages of cognitive decline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1806360,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we could discover a way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807590,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to lastingly boost people's intelligence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1810770,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be massively helpful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812360,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Maybe its best use is\nin identifying individuals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815300,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with strong intellectual abilities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1817400,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who haven't otherwise been\nable to demonstrate them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819860,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Teachers would recommend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821150,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a kid gets put in the\ngifted and talented program,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1823190,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because generally they'd observed them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826070,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doing well in the classroom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1827660,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you replace that\nwith a standardized test,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830100,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an IQ test, you find a higher\nproportion of poorer kids"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835250,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and kids from minority ethnic backgrounds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838010,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the gifted and talented\nprogram when you use an IQ test."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1841280,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason is that you're\nusing an objective measure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843650,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not just relying\non some teacher's opinion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845870,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Getting into a good school\nwas about who you knew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848420,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or who your parents knew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or how much money your parents had,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851630,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not so much about how you were doing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1853400,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea that you could try to develop"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856190,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an objective-ish measure\nthat would try and iron out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860420,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all those social biases was\nclearly a well-meaning idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865160,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- IQ is something that\nnot only psychology,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869330,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the general public has a\nlove-hate relationship with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872450,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Tell me about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873470,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Psychologists hate to\ntalk about intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876920,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and people's intelligence test\nscores and that kind of stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879890,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I've had parents, when\nI've included intelligence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884720,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as part of a neuropsychological\nevaluation of their kid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887180,
    "dDurationMs": 3206,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they'll say, \"Well, yeah,\nI'd like to know his IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890386,
    "dDurationMs": 1414,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but you know, we don't\nreally care about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891800,
    "dDurationMs": 1451,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was it?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893251,
    "dDurationMs": 1606,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(both laughing)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894857,
    "dDurationMs": 3483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And then I also think you\nhave the debate about IQ,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1898340,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "extremes on both sides,\nwhich I think doesn't help."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1902240,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have the extreme of people who say"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904580,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is the most important thing ever,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1906200,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people's IQ is a majorly important factor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908720,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we must know about them,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909553,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we can classify\nthem into particular schools,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912890,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or particular ways of\neducation or whatever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915080,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's a one extreme,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916130,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I think that's totally unproductive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918110,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's another extreme."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919040,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other extreme is the\nkind of blank slate view,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920990,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is that these tests\nare completely useless,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923210,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they don't tell us anything,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924710,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they're only a tool of\nracism and prejudice and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929690,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that's wrong as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930800,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's just this massive firestorm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932420,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on both sides happening around them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1933980,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the people in the\nmiddle just get forgotten,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935660,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the people have more moderate\nviews on these sort of topics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939050,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'd recommend that people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941660,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look for the more moderate views on this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1945020,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think the big mistake\nis thinking that IQ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1947930,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in some way determines someone's worth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950870,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's much more important, in my opinion,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1952880,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is how you interact with and\nhelp the people around you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1956810,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is why I think Stephen Hawking said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958827,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"People who brag about\ntheir IQ are losers.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1967700,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While IQ tells us something,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1969440,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it doesn't tell us how\nour lives will turn out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1971990,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have the ability to\ndramatically improve our outcomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1974840,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by building knowledge\nand analytical skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1977030,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you're looking for a\nfree and easy way to do that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1979580,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then you should check\nout this video's sponsor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981470,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brilliant.org."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1982880,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With Brilliant, you\ncan master key concepts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1985010,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in everything from data science and math"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1987050,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to programming and technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1989150,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just set your goal and Brilliant designs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991550,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the perfect learning path for you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1993140,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equipping you with the\ntools you need to succeed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1995960,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They also helped me understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997520,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how IQ and net worth are related"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1999440,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by creating some amazing\ndata visualizations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002410,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Want to learn how to think\nlike a data scientist?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2004660,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then Brilliant's latest\ncourse, Exploring Data Visually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007450,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a fast and easy way to get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009460,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It requires no coding skills,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2011410,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and instead you'll focus\non the whys behind the data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2014140,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and analyze real data sets to\nlearn things about the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017590,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In today's world, data skills\naren't just nice to have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2020680,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're essential."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022090,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant is more than\njust a learning platform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2024130,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's your path to understanding\nthe world of math,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2026440,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data and computer science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2028090,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what's great about Brilliant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029710,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that all the lessons are hands-on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2031810,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you build real intuition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2033790,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you can put what you've\nlearned to good use."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2036340,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing I didn't include\nin the main part of the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2038560,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that the only aspect of personality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2040750,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that correlates with IQ\nis openness to experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044860,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more you're willing\nto give new things a try,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047110,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the more you'll learn and\nthe smarter you'll be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2049630,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to try everything\nBrilliant has to offer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2051880,
    "dDurationMs": 4350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for free for a full 30 days,\nvisit brilliant.org/veritasium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2056230,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will put that link\ndown in the description,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2058390,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the first 200 of you to sign up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2060490,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will get 20% off Brilliant's\nannual premium subscription."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063760,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I want to thank Brilliant\nfor sponsoring this video,"
    } ]
